{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-rate-limiting","title":"分布式限流：多实例环境下的一致性挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/distributed-rate-limiting","wordCount":882,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式限流-多实例环境下的一致性挑战\">分布式限流：多实例环境下的一致性挑战</h1><p>单机限流算法在分布式系统中会遇到根本性困境：当同一用户的请求被路由到不同服务实例时，每个实例独立计数，合并后的总量可能远超设定的限制。解决这个问题的核心是将<strong>计数器状态集中化</strong>，同时处理随之而来的原子性、网络延迟和可用性问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分布式限流的根本挑战是<strong>多个服务实例共享一个计数器</strong>的一致性问题。当请求被负载均衡到不同实例时，各实例的本地计数器合并后可能超过限制。解决方案是集中化状态存储（Redis），并用原子操作（Lua 脚本）保证计数和检查的原子性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>竞态条件（超限放行）</td>\n<td>读-检查-写非原子</td>\n<td>Redis Lua 脚本原子操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络延迟增加</td>\n<td>每次检查需要 RTT</td>\n<td>本地缓存预取批量令牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis 不可用降级</td>\n<td>单点故障</td>\n<td>Fail Open / Local Fallback</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨机房一致性</td>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>最终一致性或主机房限流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[请求] --&gt; B{Redis 可用?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[Lua 原子操作&lt;br/&gt;检查+递增]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D{降级策略}&#10;    C -- 通过 --&gt; E[放行]&#10;    C -- 超限 --&gt; F[429]&#10;    D -- Fail Open --&gt; E&#10;    D -- Local Fallback --&gt; G[本地限流器]&#10;    G --&gt; E&#10;    G --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[请求] --&gt; B{Redis 可用?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[Lua 原子操作&lt;br/&gt;检查+递增]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D{降级策略}\n    C -- 通过 --&gt; E[放行]\n    C -- 超限 --&gt; F[429]\n    D -- Fail Open --&gt; E\n    D -- Local Fallback --&gt; G[本地限流器]\n    G --&gt; E\n    G --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"分布式限流的核心挑战\">分布式限流的核心挑战</h2><h3 id=\"竞态条件\">竞态条件</h3><p>假设限制为 1 req/s，两个实例同时读取计数器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"实例 A: 读取计数器 = 0  → 允许请求 → 写入计数器 = 1&#10;实例 B: 读取计数器 = 0  → 允许请求 → 写入计数器 = 1&#10;结果：2 个请求被允许，超出限制 100%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>实例 A: 读取计数器 = 0  → 允许请求 → 写入计数器 = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>实例 B: 读取计数器 = 0  → 允许请求 → 写入计数器 = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>结果：2 个请求被允许，超出限制 100%</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是经典的 TOCTOU（Time of Check to Time of Use）问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络延迟影响\">网络延迟影响</h3><p>每次限流检查都需要一次网络往返（RTT）。典型 Redis 延迟：同机房 ~0.3ms，跨区 ~5ms。对于 P99 延迟 20ms 的接口，限流检查可能增加 25% 的延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可用性权衡\">可用性权衡</h3><p>当集中式限流存储（如 Redis）不可用时，系统面临二选一：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fail Open</strong>（放行所有请求）：保证可用性，但失去限流保护</li>\n<li><strong>Fail Closed</strong>（拒绝所有请求）：保证安全性，但服务降级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"redis-原子操作-基础方案\">Redis 原子操作：基础方案</h2><h3 id=\"原子递增\">原子递增</h3><p>最简单的原子计数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function fixedWindowRedis(redis, key, limit, windowMs) {&#10;  const windowKey = `${key}:${Math.floor(Date.now() / windowMs)}`;&#10;&#10;  const pipeline = redis.multi();&#10;  pipeline.incr(windowKey);&#10;  pipeline.pttl(windowKey);&#10;  const [count, ttl] = await pipeline.exec();&#10;&#10;  // 首次创建时设置过期&#10;  if (ttl === -1) {&#10;    await redis.pExpire(windowKey, windowMs);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return count &lt;= limit;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fixedWindowRedis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> windowKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Math</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowMs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">multi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">incr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(windowKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(windowKey);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ttl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pipeline.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 首次创建时设置过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ttl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pExpire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(windowKey, windowMs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>问题：<code>INCR</code> 和 <code>PEXPIRE</code> 不是原子的，极端情况下 key 可能永不过期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lua-脚本保证原子性\">Lua 脚本保证原子性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- atomic_rate_limit.lua&#10;local key = KEYS[1]&#10;local limit = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;local window_ms = tonumber(ARGV[2])&#10;&#10;local count = redis.call(&#39;INCR&#39;, key)&#10;if count == 1 then&#10;  -- 首次创建时原子设置过期&#10;  redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, key, window_ms)&#10;end&#10;&#10;if count &gt; limit then&#10;  return {0, redis.call(&#39;PTTL&#39;, key)}&#10;end&#10;return {1, 0}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- atomic_rate_limit.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local key = KEYS[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local limit = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local window_ms = tonumber(ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local count = redis.call('INCR', key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if count == 1 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 首次创建时原子设置过期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  redis.call('PEXPIRE', key, window_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if count > limit then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return {0, redis.call('PTTL', key)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return {1, 0}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Lua 脚本在 Redis 中是原子执行的，不会被其他命令打断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式令牌桶-滑动填充策略\">分布式令牌桶：滑动填充策略</h2><p>将令牌桶状态存入 Redis Hash，利用 Lua 保证计算和更新的原子性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- distributed_token_bucket.lua&#10;local key = KEYS[1]&#10;local capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;local refill_rate = tonumber(ARGV[2])  -- 每秒令牌数&#10;local cost = tonumber(ARGV[3])&#10;local now = tonumber(ARGV[4])  -- 毫秒&#10;&#10;local data = redis.call(&#39;HMGET&#39;, key, &#39;t&#39;, &#39;v&#39;)&#10;local last_time = tonumber(data[1]) or now&#10;local tokens = tonumber(data[2]) or capacity&#10;&#10;-- 补充令牌&#10;local elapsed_sec = (now - last_time) / 1000&#10;tokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed_sec * refill_rate)&#10;&#10;if tokens &lt; cost then&#10;  local wait_sec = (cost - tokens) / refill_rate&#10;  return {0, math.ceil(wait_sec * 1000)}&#10;end&#10;&#10;tokens = tokens - cost&#10;redis.call(&#39;HMSET&#39;, key, &#39;t&#39;, now, &#39;v&#39;, tokens)&#10;-- 令牌耗尽到补满所需时间的两倍作为 TTL&#10;local ttl_ms = math.ceil((capacity / refill_rate) * 1000 * 2)&#10;redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, key, ttl_ms)&#10;return {1, 0}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- distributed_token_bucket.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local key = KEYS[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local capacity = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local refill_rate = tonumber(ARGV[2])  -- 每秒令牌数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local cost = tonumber(ARGV[3])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local now = tonumber(ARGV[4])  -- 毫秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local data = redis.call('HMGET', key, 't', 'v')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local last_time = tonumber(data[1]) or now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local tokens = tonumber(data[2]) or capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 补充令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local elapsed_sec = (now - last_time) / 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + elapsed_sec * refill_rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if tokens &#x3C; cost then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local wait_sec = (cost - tokens) / refill_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return {0, math.ceil(wait_sec * 1000)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokens = tokens - cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HMSET', key, 't', now, 'v', tokens)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 令牌耗尽到补满所需时间的两倍作为 TTL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local ttl_ms = math.ceil((capacity / refill_rate) * 1000 * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('PEXPIRE', key, ttl_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return {1, 0}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"本地缓存-redis-混合策略\">本地缓存 + Redis 混合策略</h2><p>纯 Redis 方案每次请求都有网络 RTT。对于高 QPS 接口，可以用本地缓存减少 Redis 调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class HybridRateLimiter {&#10;  constructor(redis, opts) {&#10;    this.redis = redis;&#10;    this.localWindow = opts.localWindow ?? 100; // 本地预取令牌数&#10;    this.hardLimit = opts.hardLimit; // Redis 全局硬限制&#10;    this.localCache = new Map(); // key -&gt; { tokens, expiry }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async isAllowed(key) {&#10;    // 先检查本地缓存&#10;    const local = this.localCache.get(key);&#10;    if (local &amp;&amp; local.tokens &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; local.expiry &gt; Date.now()) {&#10;      local.tokens -= 1;&#10;      return true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 本地额度耗尽，向 Redis 预取一批&#10;    const granted = await this._fetchFromRedis(key, this.localWindow);&#10;    if (granted === 0) return false;&#10;&#10;    this.localCache.set(key, {&#10;      tokens: granted - 1, // 当前请求消耗一个&#10;      expiry: Date.now() + 1000, // 本地额度有效期 1s&#10;    });&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async _fetchFromRedis(key, batchSize) {&#10;    // 尝试一次性从 Redis 扣减 batchSize 个令牌&#10;    const result = await this.redis.eval(tokenBucketScript, {&#10;      keys: [key],&#10;      arguments: [&#10;        String(this.hardLimit),&#10;        String(this.hardLimit / 60), // 每秒填充速率&#10;        String(batchSize),&#10;        String(Date.now()),&#10;      ],&#10;    });&#10;    return result[0] === 1 ? batchSize : 0;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HybridRateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.redis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#2429