i-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batchSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>权衡</strong>：本地缓存会导致实际允许的请求数略多于硬限制（最多 <code>实例数 × localWindow</code> 的过量），但大幅降低了 Redis 的 QPS 压力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最终一致性方案\">最终一致性方案</h2><p>对于允许少量超限的场景（如分析型 API），可以用异步计数代替同步检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class EventualRateLimiter {&#10;  constructor(redis, opts) {&#10;    this.redis = redis;&#10;    this.limit = opts.limit;&#10;    this.windowMs = opts.windowMs;&#10;    this.localCount = 0;&#10;    this.syncInterval = opts.syncInterval ?? 500; // ms&#10;    this.startSync();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 完全本地检查，零延迟&#10;  isAllowed() {&#10;    // 使用上次同步的远程计数 + 本地增量估算&#10;    if (this.remoteCount + this.localCount &gt;= this.limit) return false;&#10;    this.localCount += 1;&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  startSync() {&#10;    setInterval(async () =&gt; {&#10;      if (this.localCount === 0) return;&#10;      const count = this.localCount;&#10;      this.localCount = 0;&#10;      // 批量提交到 Redis&#10;      this.remoteCount = await this.redis.incrBy(this.key, count);&#10;    }, this.syncInterval);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventualRateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">opts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.redis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opts.limit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opts.windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.localCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.syncInterval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opts.syncInterval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 完全本地检查，零延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 使用上次同步的远程计数 + 本地增量估算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.remoteCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.localCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.localCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  startSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setInterval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.localCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.localCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.localCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 批量提交到 Redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.remoteCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">incrBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.key, count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.syncInterval);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可用性策略-fail-open-vs-fail-closed\">可用性策略：Fail Open vs Fail Closed</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B[尝试连接 Redis]&#10;    B -- 成功 --&gt; C[正常限流检查]&#10;    B -- 失败/超时 --&gt; D{可用性策略}&#10;    D -- Fail Open --&gt; E[允许请求&lt;br/&gt;记录降级日志]&#10;    D -- Fail Closed --&gt; F[拒绝请求&lt;br/&gt;503 Service Unavailable]&#10;    D -- Local Fallback --&gt; G[使用本地限流器&lt;br/&gt;降级到单实例精度]&#10;    C -- 通过 --&gt; H[处理请求]&#10;    C -- 超限 --&gt; I[429 Too Many Requests]\">graph TD\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B[尝试连接 Redis]\n    B -- 成功 --&gt; C[正常限流检查]\n    B -- 失败/超时 --&gt; D{可用性策略}\n    D -- Fail Open --&gt; E[允许请求&lt;br/&gt;记录降级日志]\n    D -- Fail Closed --&gt; F[拒绝请求&lt;br/&gt;503 Service Unavailable]\n    D -- Local Fallback --&gt; G[使用本地限流器&lt;br/&gt;降级到单实例精度]\n    C -- 通过 --&gt; H[处理请求]\n    C -- 超限 --&gt; I[429 Too Many Requests]</pre><p><strong>推荐策略</strong>：Local Fallback——Redis 不可用时降级到本地限流，保证基本保护能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function resilientCheck(key) {&#10;  try {&#10;    return await redisLimiter.isAllowed(key);&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    metrics.increment(&#39;rate_limiter.redis_failure&#39;);&#10;    // 降级到内存限流（较宽松的限制）&#10;    return localFallbackLimiter.isAllowed(key);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resilientCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redisLimiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rate_limiter.redis_failure'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 降级到内存限流（较宽松的限制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> localFallbackLimiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式限流的核心挑战是原子性：INCR + EXPIRE 需要用 Lua 脚本或事务保证</li>\n<li>混合策略（本地缓存预取 + Redis 硬限制）可以将 Redis QPS 降低 10-100 倍</li>\n<li>可用性策略按场景选择：安全接口 Fail Closed，通用 API 建议 Local Fallback</li>\n<li>最终一致性方案适合对精确度要求不高但对延迟极敏感的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>兄弟文档：<a href=\"api-gateway-rate-limiting\">API 网关限流</a> 讲解在基础设施层统一管控，避免在每个服务中重复实现；<a href=\"sliding-window-algorithm\">滑动窗口算法</a> 的 Lua 脚本实现与本章原子性方案相同思路。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式限流：多实例环境下的一致性挑战","id":"分布式限流-多实例环境下的一致性挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式限流的核心挑战","id":"分布式限流的核心挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"竞态条件","id":"竞态条件"},{"level":3,"text":"网络延迟影响","id":"网络延迟影响"},{"level":3,"text":"可用性权衡","id":"可用性权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"Redis 原子操作：基础方案","id":"redis-原子操作-基础方案"},{"level":3,"text":"原子递增","id":"原子递增"},{"level":3,"text":"Lua 脚本保证原子性","id":"lua-脚本保证原子性"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式令牌桶：滑动填充策略","id":"分布式令牌桶-滑动填充策略"},{"level":2,"text":"本地缓存 + Redis 混合策略","id":"本地缓存-redis-混合策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最终一致性方案","id":"最终一致性方案"},{"level":2,"text":"可用性策略：Fail Open vs Fail Closed","id":"可用性策略-fail-open-vs-fail-closed"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滑动窗口算法：精确限流的完整实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/sliding-window-algorithm"},"next":{"title":"API 网关限流：在基础设施层统一管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/api-gateway-rate-limiting"}}